  "internal_note": "Sender Dana Whitfield (user_id 1, CEO, VIP, active, not blocked). Only device: BL-LT-0101, Windows 11 Pro, online, last check-in 2026-10-11 02:53 UTC. Disk: 512 GB total, 310 GB free, 60.5% free, no warnings. KB-017 escalation threshold (under 10% free) is not met, so no cleanup or escalation indicated. Warning likely stale or about another volume. Did not run any cleanup (no remote cleanup tool). Asked user for restart, drive name, and exact message. If the warning persists after restart, re-check disk and walk through KB-017 fix steps. Mailbox 17.4% used, unrelated.",
